!.gitkeep
.claude/

# Internal strategy / planning docs — never committed
docs/
notes/
specs/
INTERNAL_*.md

# Markdown is internal working material — the only doc we ship is README.md
# (at any depth). Everything else (CONTRIBUTING, ROADMAP, specs, notes…) stays
# local and out of git.
*.md
!README.md

# MKB gate evidence is intentionally versioned; other internal Markdown stays local.
!docs/
docs/**
!docs/mkb-00-source-license-engine-inventory.md
!docs/mkb-00-apple-silicon-verification.md
!docs/mkb-w01-windows-product-isolation.md
!docs/mkb-w02-windows-internal-clean-break.md
# Durable technical contract, not a strategy memo: it defines how identity is judged, phase 05
# records results into it, and the committed plan links to it.
!docs/fingerprint-acceptance-gate.md
# Release provenance: the unsigned candidate's SHA-256 was its only origin evidence, so the
# record is versioned rather than kept local.
!docs/first-attested-release-candidate.md

# Python bytecode caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
